or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 08-29-2018, 03:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-29T21:25:26-07:00","id":1249876,"title":"","content":"The Death Gift has Word of Quiet which can be a powerful area of effect damaging ability against vampires. Obviously the Elemental Gifts, which would let you control fire.<br /> <br /> Learning how to make fetishes would be useful, since you could use it to trap helions or fire spirits and take advantage of vampire banes (don't think they're called that in 1e, but sun and fire).<br /> <br /> There's a bunch of gifts that would enhance your ability to sneak up on or track targets, and simply using them to hunt down vampires during the day would probably be a good idea, as opposed to fighting with them in the middle of the night when they can get their allies and resources to help.<br /> <br /> And I forget which gift it was, I think it was from a Pure book, but there was a power that let you basically make creatures that frenzy frenzy, and then spread that frenzy to creatures they attack or are nearby.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 08-30-2018, 12:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/