"rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-30T08:08:01-07:00","id":1249968,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aeshadiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1249677-1e-vampire-killer-werewolf?p=1249951#post1249951\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What do you think about 4dots father's wolf gift? - it changes lethals into aggravated dmg.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not Sean, but I think that's not going to do a lot to help you in a game of politics. Once the claws are out, you've already lost.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-30T10:14:05-07:00","id":1249988,"title":"","content":"Yes, for politics you would likely want more socially influential abilities rather than increasing killing power. Though the Frenzy and area of effect Gifts might still be good just in case. There's a high dot fetish, the Tooth of Death Wolf or something, that forces vampires away from it.<br /> <br /> If you were an Elodoth or Rahu there would be Beyond Reproach and Battle Mind which would give you a benefit to resisting mind control, as is you can get the Alpha Gift Lordly Will which would make you immune to them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 08-30-2018, 01:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}